					},
					"font-size": {
						"type": "float",
						"value": 19
					},
					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "MASK \nThe Mask node lets you create a Mask out of another texture or shape. There is a toggle to invert the mask.\n\nExample: We modulate a collection of circles to be used as a Mask. They are rendered to a texture before going into the mask node. This is way we don't need to instance the mask node and we preserve some computational power."
					}
				},
